    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced TPS &amp; FPS where you control a customizable mech in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize 12 parts: head, torso, arms, legs, booster, FCS, and six weapon slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and frame colors can also be customized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, jump, boost into the air, run on walls,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perform rapid boosts (horizontal, up, down), quick turns, and high-speed movement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289400/extras/b263340333676aea0c973cd1ad58002f.avif?t=1752296622\" width=800 height=439 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced TPS &amp; FPS where you control a customizable mech in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize 12 parts: head, torso, arms, legs, booster, FCS, and six weapon slots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and frame colors can also be customized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons, jump, boost into the air, run on walls,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perform rapid boosts (horizontal, up, down), quick turns, and high-speed movement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289400/extras/b263340333676aea0c973cd1ad58002f.avif?t=1752296622\" width=800 height=439 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced TPS &amp; FPS where you control a mech in battle. Customize 12 parts: head, torso, arms, legs, booster, FCS, and 6 weapons. Weapon and frame colors are changeable. Use weapons, jump, boost up, run on walls, do rapid boosts, quick turns, and high boosts.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean",
